  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "031388e8-1418-4762-a48c-b81aa0a3c6c5"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "is the list of the names of the catalogue models that ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["SullivanModel"]], "paclet:ChernSimons/ref/SullivanModel", 
    "ChernSimons Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
